{"id":"claim.jin.future-expansion","statement":"烛之武论证晋若东面扩张后仍会向西扩张，削弱秦国。","certainty":"explicit","sourceRefs":["zuozhuan.xigong30.009"],"usages":["zhuzhiwu.act-06.describe-future-risk"]}
